<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bills auction raises FIM 495 million.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bills auction raises FIM 495 million.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction April 29 versus April 22.</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   196/174		348/356</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.15/3.12	    3.37/3.40</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.15/3.13	    3.37/3.40</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.14/3.12	    3.36/3.38</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   245/410		250/400</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    365/460		480/530</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,489 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
